# Default route for static setups (DHCP interfaces get theirs from the server).
# DEFAULT 192.168.1.1
#
# Static routes: ROUTE destination[/bits] gateway (up to 16). Without /bits
# it is a route to one host. The gateway must be on one of your interfaces'
# networks. PrismNet Prefs edits these under Network settings > Routes...
# ROUTE 192.168.2.0/24 192.168.1.254
# ROUTE 10.8.0.1 192.168.1.254
